# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# SEC-FND-002 fix: scripts/feature-reflect and scripts/feature-why
# must source lib-sanitize.sh and refuse to land their bundle if a
# sensitive pattern is present. Per the PR security review on the
# SEC-FND-001 fix: same defect class existed in the sibling bundle
# writers.
